# udev deploy + verify — Session 006 (000b2)

Date: 2026-09-25T23:32:21+01:00
Rule source: packaging/udev/99-touchbar-seat.rules

## Deploy commands
```
$ sudo install -m 0644 packaging/udev/99-touchbar-seat.rules /etc/udev/rules.d/
install OK
$ sudo udevadm control --reload-rules
reload OK
$ sudo udevadm trigger --action=add --subsystem-match=input
trigger OK
```

NOTE: udev TAGs/ENV apply on next device-add or re-login. The ACL
(user:emzmo:rw- via uaccess) is granted by logind at login time — a
re-login is required for the ACL to take effect on the digitizer node.
TAG=seat-touchbar and TAG=uaccess are set by the rule immediately on trigger.
